  "title": "Chef John&#39;s Granola",
  "description": "Try this granola recipe for maple-flavored granola with nuts, seeds, and dried fruit. It makes a great snack or breakfast treat.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2012-10-04T14:11:22-04:00",
